  "description": "The concept of racial bias refers to the unfair or prejudiced treatment of individuals based on their race or ethnicity. The meme attempts to address this issue but uses a problematic method by reducing it to a superficial physical characteristic (tan skin), which can be seen as a form of microaggression.",
